			</div><!-- .vcard -->

			<div class=3D"comment-content">
				<p>Great hearty winter dish; I needed to do an extra 10min on the onion=
s. Saw some comments about lack of flavor =E2=80=93 I think this is all abo=
ut the vegetable broth you=E2=80=99re using. I used the standard grocery st=
ore box, but pre-simmered it on the stove with a teaspoon of veggie bouillo=
n and another teaspoon of umami bouillon (mushroom). This added a rich deep=
 flavor to the dish. Also based on comments I cut way back on the broth =E2=
=80=93 only used one 4-cup container. Could probably have done an extra hal=
f cup, but no more. Popped a bunch of thyme in cheesecloth to make it easie=
r to fish out. Great weekend meal!</p>
